=================================================================
=== DEMO 2 (Anh A02): Vi du 2 tren phieu: them(5); lay(); them(8) ===
=================================================================
Input theo phieu: them(5); lay(); them(8)
=== Buoc 0: Khoi tao rong ===
So luong n: 0
Trang thai: RONG
  dau  (head) --> nothing
  cuoi (tail) --> nothing
  Bat bien hop le: true

Buoc 1: them!(q, 5)
=== Sau them 5 ===
So luong n: 1
  dau  (head) --> Node(5)
  cuoi (tail) --> Node(5)
  Chuoi lien ket: [5] -> nothing
  Bat bien hop le: true

Buoc 2: v = lay!(q)
  -> Gia tri lay ra: 5 (Ky vong: 5)
=== Sau lay() (Hang doi tro ve rong) ===
So luong n: 0
Trang thai: RONG
  dau  (head) --> nothing
  cuoi (tail) --> nothing
  Bat bien hop le: true

  Kiem tra khi rong: dau === nothing (true), cuoi === nothing (true)
Buoc 3: them!(q, 8)
=== Sau them 8 ===
So luong n: 1
  dau  (head) --> Node(8)
  cuoi (tail) --> Node(8)
  Chuoi lien ket: [8] -> nothing
  Bat bien hop le: true

-----------------------------------------------------------------
KET QUA CHINH VI DU 2:
  - Gia tri lay ra: 5
  - Danh sach FIFO: [8]
  - Con tro dau:    Node(8)
  - Con tro cuoi:   Node(8)
  - dau === cuoi:   true
NHAN XET:
  Sau khi lay nut 5 lam hang doi tro ve rong, phai xoa ca con tro cuoi cu
  (cuoi = nothing) de tranh loi con tro rac truoc khi tao hang moi chua 8.

